       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TXNTEST.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT TEST-FILE ASSIGN TO TXNOUT
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD TEST-FILE RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
01 TEST-RECORD.
    COPY TXNREC.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FILE-STATUS                  PIC XX.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    OPEN OUTPUT TEST-FILE
    IF WS-FILE-STATUS NOT = '00'
        DISPLAY 'OPEN-ERROR|' WS-FILE-STATUS
        MOVE 12 TO RETURN-CODE
        GOBACK
    END-IF

    MOVE SPACES TO TXN-RAW-RECORD
    MOVE 'B' TO TXN-RECORD-TYPE
    MOVE 'ACCT000001' TO TXN-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE 1000.00 TO TXN-AMOUNT
    WRITE TEST-RECORD

    MOVE SPACES TO TXN-RAW-RECORD
    MOVE 'C' TO TXN-RECORD-TYPE
    MOVE 'ACCT000001' TO TXN-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE 125.50 TO TXN-AMOUNT
    WRITE TEST-RECORD

    MOVE SPACES TO TXN-RAW-RECORD
    MOVE 'D' TO TXN-RECORD-TYPE
    MOVE 'ACCT000001' TO TXN-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE 40.00 TO TXN-AMOUNT
    WRITE TEST-RECORD

    MOVE SPACES TO TXN-RAW-RECORD
    MOVE 'D' TO TXN-RECORD-TYPE
    MOVE 'ACCT000001' TO TXN-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE 1200.00 TO TXN-AMOUNT
    WRITE TEST-RECORD

    MOVE SPACES TO TXN-RAW-RECORD
    MOVE 'X' TO TXN-RECORD-TYPE
    MOVE 'ACCT000001' TO TXN-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE 5.00 TO TXN-AMOUNT
    WRITE TEST-RECORD

    CLOSE TEST-FILE
    GOBACK.